{'symbol': 'CTXS', 'date': '2019-10-23 22:30:00', 'title': 'CITRIX SYSTEMS, INC. ANNOUNCES QUARTERLY CASH DIVIDEND, PAYABLE ON DECEMBER 20, 2019', 'text': 'ON OCTOBER 24, 2019, CITRIX SYSTEMS, INC. ANNOUNCED THAT ITS BOARD OF DIRECTORS DECLARED A QUARTERLY CASH DIVIDEND OF $0.35 PER SHARE. THIS DIVIDEND IS PAYABLE ON DECEMBER 20, 2019 TO ALL SHAREHOLDERS OF RECORD AT THE CLOSE OF BUSINESS ON DECEMBER 6, 2019. FUTURE DIVIDENDS WILL BE SUBJECT TO BOARD APPROVAL.'}